{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26995","headline":"奉和四松 · 姚合","name":"奉和四松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四松相对植，苍翠映中台。\n擢干凌空去，移根斸石开。\n阴阳气潜煦，造化手亲栽。\n日月滋佳色，烟霄长异材。\n清音胜在涧，寒影徧生苔。\n静遶霜沾履，闲看酒满杯。\n同荣朱户际，永日白云隈。\n密叶闻风度，高枝见鹤来。\n赏心难可尽，丽什妙难裁。\n此地无因到，循环几百回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}